PHASE 9 — Real Booking Availability Calendar

Goal:
Build a real availability and booking calendar.

What to build:
- Owner availability rules.
- Blocked times.
- Available slot generation.
- Student/Parent booking request.
- Owner confirmation.
- Reschedule flow.
- Meeting link field.

Owner pages:
- /owner/calendar
- /owner/availability
- /owner/bookings

Student pages:
- /student/book
- /student/lessons

Parent pages:
- /parent/book
- /parent/child/[id]/lessons

Availability settings:
- Working days
- Start/end times
- Session duration default 90 min
- Buffer time
- Max sessions per day optional
- Blocked dates/times

Booking statuses:
- requested
- confirmed
- rejected
- reschedule_requested
- rescheduled
- canceled
- completed
- no_show

Rules:
- Prevent double booking.
- Prevent booking outside availability.
- Respect blocked time.
- Respect cancellation policy.
- Link booking to lesson package/credits.

Acceptance criteria:
- Owner creates availability.
- Student/Parent sees available slots.
- Booking request created.
- Owner confirms booking.
- Confirmed booking appears on dashboards.
- Double booking is prevented.
- Reschedule works according to policy.

Manual test checklist:
- Create availability.
- Book as student.
- Book as parent.
- Confirm as Owner.
- Try double booking same slot.
- Reschedule a lesson.

Stop condition:
Stop here. Test this phase before continuing.
